for(const scenario of ['予約授業','非表示講習'])await check(`${scenario}を含む全体復元は業務データ書込前に停止`,async()=>{const p=await open();await seed(p,'owner');await p.evaluate(async scenario=>{Object.assign(test.maintenanceState,{loaded:true,enabled:true});if(scenario==='予約授業')mem.set('timetableEntries/b_reserved',{studentId:'s',courseId:'c'});else {mem.set('specialCourses/c',{archived:true,startDate:'2026-11-12',endDate:'2026-11-12',periods:[{start:'09:00',end:'09:55'}]});mem.set('specialCourses/c/teacherAvailability/a',{slots:[]})}const archive=await test.createOwnerArchive('停止検証');mem.set('schoolStudents/s',{...mem.get('schoolStudents/s'),name:'復元前'});ops.length=0;await test.restoreOwnerArchive({...archive,label:'停止検証'})},scenario);assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>ops.length),0);assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>mem.get('schoolStudents/s').name),'復元前');await p.context().close()});

await check('全体復元で講習を再表示する場合は勤務希望も従来どおり復元',async()=>{const p=await open();await seed(p,'owner');await p.evaluate(async()=>{Object.assign(test.maintenanceState,{loaded:true,enabled:true});const c={archived:false,startDate:'2026-11-12',endDate:'2026-11-12',periods:[{start:'09:00',end:'09:55'}]};mem.set('specialCourses/c',c);mem.set('specialCourses/c/teacherAvailability/a',{slots:['2026-11-12_0']});const archive=await test.createOwnerArchive('再表示復元');mem.set('specialCourses/c',{...c,archived:true});mem.set('specialCourses/c/teacherAvailability/a',{slots:[]});await test.restoreOwnerArchive({...archive,label:'再表示復元'})});assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>mem.get('specialCourses/c').archived),false);assert.deepEqual(await p.evaluate(()=>mem.get('specialCourses/c/teacherAvailability/a').slots),['2026-11-12_0']);await p.context().close()});
await check('予約無効の講習配置は従来どおり確定し通知を保存',async()=>{const p=await open();await seedManualCourse(p,false);await p.evaluate(()=>{mem.set('specialCourses/c',test.state.courses[0]);for(const uid of ['a','b'])mem.set('specialCourses/c/teacherAvailability/'+uid,{slots:['2026-11-12_0']});test.openCourseEditor('c');test.nav('courseEditor')});await p.waitForFunction(()=>test.courseEditorCapacity.ready);await p.evaluate(()=>test.courseEditorMove('manual',{teacherUid:'b',date:'2026-11-12',start:'17:30',end:'18:25'}));await p.locator('#editorSave').click();await p.waitForFunction(()=>mem.get('timetableEntries/manual').teacherUid==='b'&&!test.courseEditor.busy);assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>mem.get('specialCourses/c/scheduleMeta/state').version),1);assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>ops.filter(x=>x[1].startsWith('notifications/')).length),2);await p.context().close()});
async function seedWork(p){await seed(p);await p.evaluate(()=>{const s=test.state;Object.assign(s,{date:'2026-11-17',teacherWeeklyWorkStatus:'ready',teacherDateWorkStatus:'ready',teacherWeeklyWork:{a:{weekdays:[1,4]},b:{weekdays:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6]}},teacherDateWork:{}});s.students[0].regularSlots.r.weekday=2;const {id,...data}=s.students[0];mem.set('schoolStudents/'+id,data);mem.set('teacherWeeklyWork/a',{weekdays:[1,4]});mem.set('teacherWeeklyWork/b',{weekdays:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6]});test.regularEditor.reset();})}
const workCell=(p,uid,n)=>p.locator(`.normal-cell[data-uid="${uid}"][data-period="${n}"]`);
await check('統合: 新機能未有効なら新コレクションを購読せず従来バックアップを維持',async()=>{const p=await open();await seed(p,'owner');await p.evaluate(async()=>{mem.set('users/mgr',{role:'owner',name:'運営'});mem.set('systemConfig/maintenance',{enabled:false});authMock.currentUser={uid:'mgr'};await authCallback(authMock.currentUser)});await p.waitForFunction(()=>test.state.entriesStatus==='ready');assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>subscriptionPaths.includes('teacherWeeklyWork')||subscriptionPaths.includes('teacherDateWork')),false);assert.equal(await p.locator('#navTeacherManagement').isHidden(),true);await p.evaluate(()=>test.createOwnerArchive('従来形式'));assert.equal(await p.evaluate(()=>[...mem.keys()].some(k=>k.startsWith('backupArchives/'))),true);await p.context().close()});
